window.products.push({"id":775013,"name":"Tea Infuser Spoon Drip Tray Gift Set for Loose Tea 3 Size Premium Strainers 3 Drip Trays 1 Spoon. Extended Weighted Chain, Durable Reusable Safe Stain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFHz7duUL._AC_SL1386_.jpg","description":"FOR AVID TEA DRINKERS. Why is CentiMom’s the best tea infuser set available? We took the time to solve the most common problems faced by distinguished loose tea drinkers. [1] Our longer chains with open hook makes it easy to loop the chain around your cup handle and set your desired steeping height. The weighted medallion holds the hook in place. (customer: \"the hanging weighted charm doesn't let the chain fall into the abyss of your cup\") [2] Fine infusers holes will only allow powder or very fine teas to escape (customer: \"it is fantastic. We use it every day and have no tea leaves escape from the infuser. We love it.\") [3] All infusers come with a drip tray to avoid mess after steeping (customer: \"love the thoughtfulness of the design to keep messes to a minimum\") [4] The flat infuser base and wide opening makes it easy to fill. It also includes a one teaspoon measuring spoon to make it easy to fill. [5] Easy twist on and off lid [6] Made of 100% stainless steel for long durable repeated use [7] Stainless steel means no fear of materials breaking down and leaving chemicals in your otherwise healthy cup of tea. It also eliminates residual flavors [8] Wide open base makes clean-up a breeze [9] Three different sizes to meet every need - tea cup, mug, pitcher, tea pot, cooking with spices. Have a single cup or hold a tea party. Take one to work and leave two at home [10] Premium stainless steel infusers, drip trays, and tea spoon to match your stainless steel kitchen (customer: \"The stainless steel is gorgeous and they are all so easy to use. I have to say that I was absolutely shocked at the quality of these tea strainers\")","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFHz7duUL._AC_SL1386_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CentiMom","source_asin":"B014U4P5MO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014U4P5MO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014U4P5MO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
