window.products.push({"id":775145,"name":"Adewnest Ceramic Bowls with Lids: 5 + 6 in Porcelain Bowls Set with Spoons & Forks - Food Storage Containers for Lunch/Picnic - Microwave Oven Safe Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612+IKjC5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Versatile Bowl】: These deep bowls with vented lids are perfect for daily use or carrying out, such as working lunch, picnic, camping, office meal, food storage, meal prep. Thanks to their deep and straight design, they can be widely used for salad, pasta, cereal, soup, rice, popcorn, noodle, ramen, without spillage. 【You Can Get】: This set of ceramic bowls includes two large and two small bowls(6 inch & 5 inch bowls), 4 hermetic silicone lid, 2 dinner spoons & 2 dinner forks. The maximum capacity of a 6 inch bowl is 34 oz, 5 inch bowls is 20 oz, with simple but modern design in bright and comfortable color. 【Keep Food Fresh】: With the tight vented lid, these porcelain kitchen bowls are perfect for meal prep and storage. The 100% hermetic silicone made lids are great at keeping food fresh and warm. Note: Please do not put the seal lid into the microwave or dishwasher. 【Practical Bowls】: The lids are in stackable design that you can store the bowls easily.When you cover the lid, the liquid cannot flow out even if it is tilted for a short time (please do not tilt for a long time), so when you go out with food that contains liquid, you don't need to worry about the food spilling.The flip top design allows you to use the bowl with lid in microwave when lid top pop up. 【Healthy and Safe Materials】: Bowls are made in High-quality ceramic, which is ideal food container material. It's lead-free and non-toxic. It is resistant to high and low temperature. Suitable for all kinds of food in your daily life, the smooth surface is very easy to clean. Dishwasher and microwave safe.The spoons and forks are made of 18/0 stainless steel with pearl color coasting, also suitable for dishwasher.The PP lids is BPA free and the silicone ring make it in good seal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612+IKjC5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adewnest","source_asin":"B096QTX8C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096QTX8C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096QTX8C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":775146,"name":"Antoni Barcelona Whiskey Bourbon Crystal Glasses 12Oz SET 2 Sagrada Hand Painted Handmade Mouth Blown Unique Cocktail Bar Gifts Women Men Dad Spiritua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719RLzxhn0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANTONI BARCELONA’s Glassware Excellent Premium Exclusive Hand Painted, Handmade crafted of fine non-leaded crystal with a sleek, modern shape, each can hold 12 ounces of your favorite Scotch bar glasses for enthusiasts that enjoy spiritual drinks & Whiskey Lovers. No two are exactly alike. 100% Lead-Free Crystal. THE PERFECT GIFT - Whether purchased for yourself or for someone who appreciates the finer things in life, Antoni Barcelona glassware is a true testament to luxury and fine living. Make a great impression when you give them a gift that’s so much more than just a whiskey glass – it’s a usable piece of art. These sophisticated, vibrantly colored whiskey glasses make the ultimate Unique gift for wife, men, women, Liquor, whiskey & Bourbon lovers & beyond! Due to the handmade nature of the product. UNIQUE DESIGN INSPIRED BY SAGRADA FAMILIA BARCELONA Our Drinkware is inspired by the breathtaking banks of stain-glassed windows of the Sagrada Familia Cathedral in Barcelona. The Cathedral draws over 2.5 million visitors annually and has become a nationally recognized landmark for Barcelona and throughout the world. Hold our mastepieces up to the light and experience mesmerizing colors and patterns so glorious, it’s as if the Cathedral's brilliant sunlit windows have come to rest in your hand. ANTONI BARCELONA - ALL OCCASIONS - 12 oz Whiskey Glass, Sets Rocks Style Glassware for Bourbon and Old Fashioned Cocktails. These gorgeous stemless glasses are made with only the finest materials and are artistically styled to add distinction to your barware line up, poker night, pool party, glass tumbler, bar glasses, Scotch Glasses, Whiskey Glass, Bourbon glass, liquor glass, lowball glasses. HAND-MADE: Each glass is masterfully mouth-blown by highly trained artisans who have enough experience to be deemed masters of the craft. After being crafted, each glass is softly painted with an ultra-thin brush so that even the tiniest details can be accurately rendered. Everything from the mixing the colors to properly match the sunny windows of the Cathedral, to the artist's delicate brush strokes, are performed with a steady and masterful hand. The end result is a one-of-a-kind work of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719RLzxhn0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antoni Barcelona","source_asin":"B07RH6QBZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RH6QBZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RH6QBZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
