window.products.push({"id":775186,"name":"Neo Fresh 600 Thread Count 100% Cotton Luxury 4 Piece Bed Sheet Set, Queen Sheets Sateen Weave, Soft & Silky, Wrinkle Free, Low Pill, Quick Dry, Paten","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rNSgGmiJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cotton Imported from LEEDv4 Silver Certified Factory in India DIMENSION: Experience craftsmanship at it’s best . The sheet is finished with double needle Hem for a sophisticated look. We include a Smart tag on the sheet which indicates the width side of the fitted sheet for ease of use. Queen Set includes a 92 x 102 inches flat Sheet, 60 x 80 + 16 inches fitted Sheet which fits up to 18 inches Mattress, and 2 Queen Pillowcases of 20 x 30 inches. FEATURES: Sink into unbelievable comfort with our 600 Thread Count Sheet Set. Crafted out of the finest long staple fibres, experience the soft hand feel of these 100% cotton sheets. Soft and silky for extended comfort. This sheet set is resistant wrinkle and shrink and pills low. Fabrics made of long-staple cottons. The longer the cotton fibre, the stronger, softer, finer and more durable is the fabric. These sheets last for a longer duration; even after several washes. PERFECT FIT NO POP OUTS: Addressing your needs for easy to use and snug fitting sheets, our team has created the True Grip fit technology to provide a perfect fit solution for your bed. These fitted sheets fit mattress height ranging from 7 to 18 inches. Our patented technology for fitted sheet provides 1” wide boxer elastic on the edges of fitted sheet along with ½” elastic on drop of the sheets to provide a snug fit. This ensures your sheets stays in place with varying depths of mattress. NOTHING BUT THE BEST CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE: In our quest to deliver a better sleep experience through outstanding bedding, we use the best equipment from around the world in our state-of-the-art facilities. Furthermore, our skilled and experienced employees are in control of the entire process including product development and design, sourcing of cotton, spinning, weaving, processing, cut-n-sew, and branding under one roof to have complete control of the quality in each tailor made sheet set. CARE INSTRUCTION: Machine wash, Do not bleach, Do not dry clean, Tumble dry normal, Iron medium, Dry in shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rNSgGmiJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"darbrrd","source_asin":"B07NWNVWJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NWNVWJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NWNVWJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
