window.products.push({"id":775202,"name":"Giantex Vanity Dressing Table Set with Stool, Tri Folding Vintage Vanity Makeup Dressing Table Set 5 Drawers Christmas, Large Vanities with Bench (Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WjdJIsHoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 Functional Drawers And Non-Slip Scratch-Resistant Pads】Our dressing table has 5 drawers, 2 on the mirror stand on the table, and 3 drawers in the middle of the table. When you remove the mirror, the vanity table becomes a writing desk. It still has 2 drawers for you to store office supplies, quite convenient and practical. There are protective non-slip pads on the bottom of the table and chair legs to prevent the floor from being scratched. 【Tri Folding Mirror and Luxury Vanity Table】This dressing table set has luxury style carving and delicate in crafsmanship. It increases the deluxe atmosphere for your room. The tri-folding mirror is for all angles' dressing and a perfect makeup. You will have a true reflection with our HD real glass mirror. 【Detachable Top and Dual Use Writing Desk】To make this table more multifunctional and saves the hassle of purchasing two tables, this dressing table top mirror stand can be removed to be a writing desk. And it is very convenient to detach it. After you take down the mirror, the dressing table will immediately become a writing desk and can be used as a ordinary table for your daily study and office work. 【Stable Table with 100% Solid Wood Legs】The table top is made of a very thick board to ensure its firmness. In order to increase the weight capacity of the table, the dressing table and chair legs are made of 100% solid wood. Therefore, the entire dressing table set is very firm and stable, it is not easy to shake, and it is very durable after careful maintenance and use. You don't need frequent replacement. 【Superior Hardware and Hinge and Stable-Leg Design】Have you ever bought rusted furniture? This has an impact on the aesthetic and practical life of the furniture. The hardware we use for this vanity table set is rust-proof and can withstand long-term use, eliminating the need for frequent replacement. Moreover, the four feet of the table are not perpendicular to the ground, but are inclined outwards. This design greatly increases the stability of the table and durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WjdJIsHoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B07KG8XC6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KG8XC6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KG8XC6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
