window.products.push({"id":775233,"name":"Ohba Glass Cut Glass 江戸切子 Edo Kiriko, Japanese Traditional Craft in Gift Box 光る宙 Milky Way (Ultramarine/Amber)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":730.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713bbWIgMYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Once you see this glass, you will take it with sigh contentedly because of its beauty and detailed engraving.【What is Edo Kiriko?】-Edo Kiriko(江戸切子) is founded by Kagaya Kyubei in 1834. He started to carve a glass with using emery powder in Edo, now known as Tokyo.-During Meiji Era(1868－1912), Edo Kiriko introduced to European glass cutting skill. It combined both original and European techniques. It is the current Edo Kiriko.-In 2002, Edo Kiriko was designated as Japanese traditional craft by the Minister of Economy, Trade and Industry.【Master of Traditional Crafts-伝統工芸士】-This license is established by The Association for the Promotion of Traditional Craft Industries(DENSAN) in 1974 in Japan.-People who want to get the license must work as a craftman in specific area for more than 12 years and live in the origin area of craftarts. -They take exam and interview which is arranged by DENSAN.-People who are given that license have an obligation to preserve original traditional craft.-Nowadays, about 7,700 traditional craftsmen are registered. 【Ohba glass-大場硝子】-Toshio Ohba started in 1966.-His son, Kazutoshi who has traditional craftsmen license takes over the workshop and creates Edo Kiriko with three staffs. -They provide handcrafted sake cup and multipurpose-old glass which are themed Japanese four seasons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713bbWIgMYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ohba Glass","source_asin":"B07GB4RJL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GB4RJL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GB4RJL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
