window.products.push({"id":775272,"name":"Ougual 50pcs Coloring Rattan Reed Diffuser Replacement Refill Sticks (9\" x4mm, Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hcL37T78L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Features: 1.Works well with most of the essential oil, Each rattan sticks contains about 20~30 \"channels\" . Much like \"mini-straws\", these channels will \"suck\" the oil up.  2.Simply place reed sticks into diffuser bottle, the oil will saturate into reeds, and as it wicks up the reeds, it will release the aroma into the air.  3.It will take a few days for the reeds to absorb the oil,different oil with different time. To make the reeds work better, turn reeds up side down once a week,replace reed sticks once a month. 4.Reed Diffusers have proven to be the most effective way to add scents to our living space. Specification: ItemSize: 9\" x 4mm Diameter Color: Brown Note: It will take a few days for the reeds to absorb the oil then carry the scent into the air，different oil with different time，we highly appreciate your understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hcL37T78L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ougual","source_asin":"B07CN73LJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CN73LJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CN73LJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
