window.products.push({"id":775365,"name":"Efavormart Wonderland Rosette Premium Table Runners for Weddings Party Banquets Decor Fit Rectangle and Round Table - Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wEwirNvLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Satin Table RunnerAdd oodles of flair and character in your party with our enticing raised rosette table runner, which is simply breathtaking. The very sight of this floral ecstasy will bring the divine vision of a paradise garden with its whimsical blossoms and luster into your event/celebration.Rosette Table RunnerFor those special and rare celebrations that need to have an extra doting touch in their ambiance decoration, this top-notch rosette linen is a picture perfect choice. The lustrous texture and hue of these satin roses symbolize glee, feat, and an aspiration to achieve even bigger dreams. Showcase your triumphant jubilancy to the world with this festive piece of art.Square Table OverlayFor those special and rare celebrations that need to have an extra doting touch in their ambiance decoration, this top-notch rosette linen is a picture perfect choice. The lustrous texture and hue of these satin roses symbolize glee, feat, and an aspiration to achieve even bigger dreams. Showcase your triumphant jubilancy to the world with this festive piece of art.Additional Information:How To Care: Machine washable with Cold waterUses: Wedding, Party, Event, Banquet, Restaurant Decoration","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wEwirNvLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"efavormart.com","source_asin":"B07HJGDG4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJGDG4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJGDG4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
