window.products.push({"id":775402,"name":"Whistling Tea Kettle, 3 L Food Grade Stainless Steel Tea Pots for Stove Top, Hot Water Fast To Boil Cool Grip Ergonomic Handle Loud Whistle and Anti-R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cTYahPaqL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The whistling teapot is a stylish highlight in the kitchen. Grab the handle to keep it cool, handle and pour water easily. The comfortable ergonomic grip provides an extra safe grip on the kettle even when it is full of water. The wide-mouth lid can be removed for easy filling and cleaning of this teapot.   When the water was boil, the howling spout made a loud and pleasant whistle. The polished stainless steel surface adds luster to your kitchen!  Product details: Product name: Whistling Tea Kettle Color: red, orange, purple, green, light blue, dark blue Size: height 19CM/7.48inch, bottom diameter 18.5CM/7.28inch Capacity: 3L, equivalent to 8 cups of 250ml glass cups Weight: 300g/0.66lb Material: Food grade high quality stainless steel Scope of application: induction cooker, electric ceramic stove, gas stove, natural gas stove, etc.  Features: 1. When the water is boiling, the kettle will automatically sound its whistle, which is loud but not harsh, reducing safety hazards. 2. Ring grip, ergonomic design, comfortable hand feeling, made of PP material, high temperature resistance, corrosion resistance   Note: 1.when using an open flame to heat, the flame should not be too large, otherwise it will damage the PP dust cover of the nozzle, and for safety, please use a small fire to heat it. 2. The water level should not exceed the water volume MAX line, otherwise it will easily cause the water to overflow, damage the original or cause a short circuit 3. The hardness of water in different regions is different, use citric acid or special descaling agent according to need 4. Use a soft cloth to wipe clean the surface of the kettle body. Do not use steel wire balls to avoid scratches. 5. After the water is boiled, the surface temperature of the kettle body is high, so do not touch it. Keep it out of reach of children to avoid danger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cTYahPaqL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hzw","source_asin":"B092M9NY5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092M9NY5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092M9NY5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
