window.products.push({"id":775515,"name":"Chocolate Molds, 4Pcs Silicone Molds for Baking, Hot Chocolate Bomb Mold with 6 Semi Sphere Jelly Holes, Chocolate Molds Silicone for Making Hot Choco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BLhSh02bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Food Grade Silicone] Sphere silicone mold is made of food grade silicone, BPA free, strong flexibility. They keep safe, durable and highly elastic, so you can use chocolate molds safely. [ High Heat Resistance] Hot cocoa bomb mold for baking are suitable for the temperature from -40°F to 446°F (-40°C to 230°C). They are safe to use in microwave, ovens, refrigerator, freezer and dishwasher. The hot cocoa bombs mold will not break or crack easily like plastic trays. [Multi Purpose] Each silicone molds cavity diameter is 2.1'' / 5.4 cm( Mold Size: 7.7” x 5.3” x 1” 19.5 cm / x 13.5 cm / 2.5 cm). With 6 holes, you can easily make chocolate bombs, hot cocoa bombs, cake decorations, fondant, dome mousse, raindrop cake, ice cream cake, chiffon cake, muffin and dessert like Gumdrop, yogurt drop, gelatin drop, jelly, pudding, bread, even handmade soap, wax, resin dome and bath bomb and more. [Easy to Release and Clean] The hot chocolate bombs mold is made of non-stick material. It is easy to take out the hot chocolate bomb intact from the hot cocoa bomb mold. After cooling, just press it lightly and pop out with finger. Don't worry about cracking or the recipe sticking on them. After finish the cooking, just wash them by hand or just put them in the dishwasher. Super easy! [Service Guarantee] Each Package includes 4 Pcs silicone chocolate molds. If you have any questions about our hot chocolate bombs mold, please contact us. We attach great importance to customer satisfaction, so we will reply to you promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BLhSh02bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTEHETOT","source_asin":"B0BFQTVDJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQTVDJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQTVDJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
