window.products.push({"id":775539,"name":"CHFONG Memory Foam Pillow for Pain Relief Sleeping - Ergonomic Cervical Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain, Orthopedic Contour Neck Support Bed Pillow ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AWc-ZjkrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ Relieve Neck & Back Pain - High-density memory foam neck support pillow for sleep can perfectly fit the physiological curve of the human body and provide support for the head and neck, while dispersing the pressure on the head and neck, reducing cervical problems. Neck pillow for sleep pain relief reduces shoulder pressure to achieve a healthy sleep, waking up in the morning without pain. ⭐ Ergonomic Design - Memory foam pillow with innovative ergonomic curve designs for stretching your neck and spine - the concave part on the central area provide support for your head while relieving pressure on the head. Side sleeping area relieves pressure on your face and ears. Pillow for side sleepers, back and stomach sleepers. Fall asleep faster and get rid of pain. ⭐ 2 Heights in 1 Pillow for Any Sleep Style - Our Neck pillows for pain relief sleeping has 2 different contour heights on either side. The higher side provides better support for the head and cervical - Ideal for back sleepers with cervical issues to keep your neck aligned with your body. The lower side/stomach sleepers can sleep on the lower side to relieve your shoulder pressure. ⭐ 5S Slow Rebound Memory Foam Pillow - Made of 100% pure natural premium memory foam pillow with a perfect balance between firmness and softness, our side sleeper pillow can provide maximum comfort without any harmful substance. Our memory foam neck pillows core has ample breathable honeycomb holes, which can maximize the air circulation and make the sleep cool and comfortable. NOTE: NEVER WASH THE MEMORY FOAM. ⭐ Breathable & Removable Pillowcase - Memory foam neck pillows features a double layered breathable chemical free ice silk pillowcase with easy detachable elastic band, removable and machine washable. The breathable cover creates better air circulation to keep you cool and comfortable throughout the night. You will fall asleep faster and deeper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AWc-ZjkrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHFONG","source_asin":"B0B7QQWX54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7QQWX54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7QQWX54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
