window.products.push({"id":775584,"name":"Fonteme 12oz Plastic Bottle with Black Lid & Straw Tamper Evident Seal Leak-Resistant BPA-Free Plastic User Friendly Fridge Safe Reusable Perfect for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aQU2xz3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY DURABLE PLASTIC MATERIAL: Fonteme 12oz Plastic Bottle & cap is made from high-quality food-grade, BPA Free PET thick plastic completely free from harmful phthalates and toxins. Unlike glass bottles, the Fonteme plastic bottle is lightweight and comes with a 12oz. maximum capacity makes it perfect for storing water, juices, and milkshakes. The Fonteme Bottle is environmentally sustainable. TAMPER EVIDENT LIDS WITH LEAK-RESISTANT SEAL: The Bottle comes with tamper-evident lids that are completely leaking resistant and do not spills the drink outside. The Lid prevents tampering and unintended opening by keeping beverages fresh for days. Fonteme Plastic Bottles tamper-evident lid locks the beverages freshness making users enjoy the beverages. EASY TO CLEAN AND CARRY: Fonteme 12oz Plastic Bottle with Cap can be easily cleaned with a mild dishwashing liquid. Users can also hand wash the bottle with warm water and a sponge brush. However, the bottles are not dishwasher free. Apart from it, the bottle is easy to carry. It can be conveniently carried outdoors by tucking in a purse or bag. GREAT VALUE SAVER PACK: Fonteme 12oz Plastic Bottle with Lid comes with a pack of 12 bottles and 20 Straws perfect for homes, juice bars, and restaurants. Whether you’re packing milk for school lunch, storing baby formula, or making a green smoothie for your workout, our bottles will hold up to the task. VERSATILE AND MULTIFUNCTIONAL: Fonteme 12oz Plastic Bottle is a perfect choice for all the drinks. From carrying juices, beverages, protein shakes, and smoothies to water, our Fonteme plastic bottle preserves the freshness of the drinks for longer. Every bottle’s quality is assured before it is delivered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aQU2xz3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fonteme","source_asin":"B0B5FC9HTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FC9HTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FC9HTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
