window.products.push({"id":775595,"name":"CoTa Global Atlantic Anchor Welcome Nautical Decor Sign - Nautical Themed Wood Sign, Beach Decor for Wall, Novelty White and Blue Starfish and Anchor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LzaM6caHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE BEACH THEME WALL SIGN COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Set a nice beach-themed ambience or enjoy a relaxing day with CoTa Global's Atlantic Anchor Welcome Nautical Decor Sign. Artistically designed to match with other nautical home decors. Men and women will love to accessorize their walls with a stylish beach wall sign that will upgrade the look of their home decor. A must-have beach wall sign for all nautical decor lovers. THE NAUTICAL WALL SIGN IS FOR EVERYONE WHO LOVES TO BRING THE BEACH VIBES INDOORS – Nautical decoration makes a great gift for nautical lovers and those who love to travel, explore the ocean and spend time at the beach. Fits any nautical themed room for a nautical lover or home decorator to accessorize rooms. Collectors of beautiful ocean life figures will be thrilled to have the Atlantic Nautical Anchor Wall Sign added to their collection. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF COASTAL WALL SIGN - Includes 1 CoTa Global Atlantic Anchor Nautical Wall Sign that features a Welcome text with starfish and anchor design with rustic accents and distressed texture. Adorned with intricate details and colored in white and blue color. Fits perfectly in any existing sea-themed room decor. The beachy wall decor sign measures 13Lx1.25Wx11H and fits perfectly as nautical hanging decor. HIGH-QUALITY ATLANTIC NAUTICAL WOOD SIGN FOR WALL – Made of premium quality wood, crafted with lightweight materials, adorned with starfish and anchor figures on the beach sign. The cute hanging wall decor is a durable beach-themed accessory with a rustic rope and distressed texture, ideal for hanging. Designed perfectly for indoors and outdoors. Maintain the beach theme Anchor wall sign accent by gently surface wiping it with a damp cloth. IDEAL USE FOR THE ANCHOR WELCOME WOOD SIGN - Bring nautical beach vibes to your home by displaying a novelty Atlantic Anchor Wooden Nautical Beach Wall Sign that can be used to set nice mood on any indoor or outdoor space. A home decor that brings beautiful memories of life by the ocean. Add to any bathroom, living room, or bedroom. Turn an ocean or nautical party space into a remarkable setup with Nautical Anchor Beach Sign as a wall accessory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LzaM6caHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B01M26DR1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M26DR1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M26DR1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
