window.products.push({"id":775753,"name":"Airfree Iris 3000 Filterless Silent Room Air Purifier, 650 sq. ft, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":202.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cbT49DpiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Airfree P3000 purifier is perfect for bedrooms, and offices. The filterless air purifier comes in a beautiful modern design. No setup is required. Plug into the outlet straight out of the box. For optimal cleaning power, keep the unit on at all times in an open spot where air can flow freely. Place the unit on tabletops, floors, counters, or desktops. Suitable for up to 650 ft, our P3000 model offers the same performance and efficiency It takes up no space, requires no maintenance, and operates in complete silence. Our patent and Eco TSS filterless technology use boiling water to sterilize the air acting as a germ-killing deodorizer. Inside are 32 mini-ducts in the ceramic core. The contaminated air is heated to 400ºF for sufficient time for sterilization. Sterilized air passes over the ceramic cooling plate. Then the purified air is cooled. Slightly heated air rises before returning to the environment, then negative pressure forces bad air into the base of the appliance. The P3000 model is powered by air convection, with no use of a noisy, loud fan. Our P3000 purifier creates a silent continuous purification cycle, thus removing microorganisms by heat. Neutralizing up to 99.99% of bacteria, pollen, pet allergens, dust mite, and other organic air pollutants. Measurements Weight - 3.5 lb Dimensions - 10.4 in x 8.4 in Low Energy - 52 W Warranty - 2 years","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cbT49DpiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airfree","source_asin":"B014UPR24M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014UPR24M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014UPR24M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
