window.products.push({"id":775815,"name":"Dust Mite- and Allergen-Proof Comforter Cover; “Premium Microfiber” (Full; White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":204.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TjkWALUrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These covers are made from MISSION: ALLERGY Premium Microfiber Fabric, the ultimate allergen-barrier: totally effective, silky soft, and lightweight. It is extremely tightly woven, with a mean pore size of 2 microns to block all allergens, yet is air-permeable, making it completely comfortable to use. It is not hot and sweaty, as are barrier-fabrics made with membranes, and does not allow any allergen escape, as do many cotton barrier-fabrics. MISSION: ALLERGY Allergen-Proof Comforter Covers can be used as part of an allergen-avoidance program. In addition to encasing the pillow and mattress, it is important to eliminate allergen exposure from the blanket. The alternatives are: washing the blanket in warm or hot water weekly, replacing the blanket with an Allergen-Proof Comforter, or using this Comforter Cover to encase an existing comforter. These medical-grade comforter covers have high quality sewing construction, with bound seams, quality zippers, and an interior zipper flap to prevent allergen escape through the zipper webbing. They are the ultimate allergen-proof comforter covers for comfort, protection, and durability. Color-coordinated Shams and Bedskirts are also available. 100% Woven Polyester Microfiber. “… protect both your pillows and your mattress with special mite-proof covers, experts say. Be sure you get covers from a reputable company, like Mission: Allergy…” THE NEW YORK TIMES \"Much Ado About Dust Mites\" 3/4/11 “Say sayonara to dust mites. The fix is to use hypoallergenic encasements on my mattress and pillows. Dr. Fost recommends Mission: Allergy.” HEALTH MAGAZINE \"How healthy is your bedroom?\" 3/9/11 “…The first step in your mite-control mission: the right pillow and mattress covers. Skip the cheapie versions—their weave isn't tight enough. Instead, invest in Mission: Allergy Premium Microfiber Allergen-Proof Encasings.” MEN’S HEALTH MAGAZINE \"Clearing the Air on Allergies\" 1/25/12","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TjkWALUrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mission","source_asin":"B0096EA3FS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0096EA3FS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0096EA3FS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
