window.products.push({"id":775851,"name":"Extra Large Wood Cutting Board for Kitchen Thick Wooden Cutting Board With Handle 13.8x19.7x1.2 inch Ucarfor Butcher Block Chopping Boards for Meat, V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PBP5qLPyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"<ul> <li><b>【NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY】</b>This natural wood cutting board is cut and polished directly from trees. Shows natural texture, with a simple and generous temperament. Without any splicing ,so it's  no need any glues, which won't get break as easily as universal patchwork wood cutting board.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><b>【TABILITY & REVERSIBLE】</b>The large natural Extra Thick wood board provides stability while cutting, and the Large Wood Cutting Board with Handle provide grip for easy carrying and serving. You can use it not only as cutting boards for food prepping, but also as cheese board, breakfast plate etc.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><b>【SLID-PROOF MAT】</b>There are two mats on the bottom of the wooden cutting board, preventing slide efficiently and also making the cutting board dry quickly so as to get away from mould. </li> </ul> <ul> <li><b> 【EASY CARE】</b>It is easy to wash and clean.  But pls do not soak in water; pls do not use in dishwasher or oven such kind of high temperature equipments; pls do not dry direct under the sun for a long time,as it may damage the natural wood. In order to keep its good appearance, please wipe the board by little mineral oil regularly, about once a month. </li> </ul> <p> </p> <ul> <li><b>【Fine Gift】</b> Our natrual cutting board wooden could be an attractive and practical gift to celebrate new house movement, weddiing, Christmas, Birthday, Engagement, Parent's Anniversary, Mother Day, Father Day and any other special days.</li></ul>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PBP5qLPyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ucarfor","source_asin":"B083VSJZ14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083VSJZ14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083VSJZ14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
