window.products.push({"id":775896,"name":"Martinez Pottery Heritage Blue Stripe Stoneware Mixing Bowls USA Made Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":200.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ed09fC1rL._AC_.jpg","description":"These days, it's a tall order to find high-quality pottery crafted here in the USA. These stoneware bowls will last a lifetime and become family heirlooms to pass down from generation to generation - and that's the kind of quality that can't be bought in a big department store. Set of four bowls: 10\", 12\", 14\" 16\" OD.. Hand-turned in Texas. Traditional, \"antique-store\" look and feel, but they're made for modern kitchens. Lead-free. Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. They can go straight to the table for effortless serving, too. USA made. Helpful Hint: If you're storing these bowls inside each other, place something in between them to help prevent scratching, like a paper towel.We're so pleased to offer you this set of beautiful, heavy-duty stoneware bowls. The huge 16\"OD bowl is the largest we've seen and holds a whopping 44 cups - that's 2-3/4 gallons! 10\"OD Bowl - Holds approx. 12 cups, 3-3/4 lb. 12\" OD Bowl - Holds approx. 20 cups, 5-3/4 lb. 14\" OD Bowl - Holds approx. 29 cups, 8 lb. 16\"OD Bowl - Holds approx. 44 cups, 11 lb. Note: Since these items are made by hand, dimensions may slightly vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ed09fC1rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martinez Pottery","source_asin":"B07P56PGZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P56PGZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P56PGZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
