window.products.push({"id":775924,"name":"Olive Wood Salad Bowl | Handmade Artisan Bowl | 100% Natural Wood | Perfect for Salads, Serving, Entertaining | Beautiful Wood Grain Made in Tunisia (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YS0boxznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful bowls are made from a solid piece of wood which makes them precious and unique.  Each hand made bowl offers a unique grain  - as unique as is each tree. Watch the video below to see how each bowl is made, individually.  Najib is the artisan that made these bowls. These bowls are more rustic and bulky than those from Italy- but equally beautiful. Each bowl differs in size and depth so you can be sure that you are getting a one of a kind bowl. They are all beautiful and perfect for salads, serving bowl, fruit bowl, or even a decoration piece. You can use these bowls for anything your imagination can come up with. Having these olive wood bowls in your home brings warmth and a touch of elegance that can only enhance your kitchen experience. It's a perfect gift for anyone who loves unique items and loves the kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YS0boxznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruccello Olive Oil","source_asin":"B08RY885RL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-775924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RY885RL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RY885RL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
